  <para unique="1091552" format="xIndent1">Non-EVEX-encoded instruction, see <link unique="1091550" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#35386: 06_Table: Table 2-20. Type 3 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;20, &#8220;Type 3 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  <para unique="1091556" format="xIndent1">EVEX-encoded instruction, see <link unique="1091554" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#63155: 06_Table: Table 2-47. Type E3 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;49, &#8220;Type E3 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
